  description="Porcelain veneers, contact lenses, and composite bonding in Ipanema. Smile Test Drive preview with iTero scanner. Dr. Carla Christoph, CRO-RJ 27.509."
  canonical="https://dracarlachristoph.com/en/veneers-and-lenses"
  ogImage="https://dracarlachristoph.com/og-image.jpg"
  preloadImage="/lovable-uploads/dra-carla-jaleco-bracos-cruzados.webp"
  schemas={schemas}
  lang="en"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt-BR" href="https://dracarlachristoph.com/lentes-de-contato-dental-e-facetas-de-resina" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://dracarlachristoph.com/en/veneers-and-lenses" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://dracarlachristoph.com/lentes-de-contato-dental-e-facetas-de-resina" />
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- ═══ Hero ═══ -->
    <section class="t-hero" aria-label="Treatment hero">
      <div class="content-c">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
              <a href="/en">Home</a>
              <Fragment set:html={ic('chevronRight', 'crumb-sep', 14)} />
              <a href="/en">Treatments</a>
              <Fragment set:html={ic('chevronRight', 'crumb-sep', 14)} />
              <span class="crumb-cur">Lenses &amp; Veneers</span>
            </nav>
            <h1 class="hero-title treatment-hero-title">Dental Aesthetics That Don't Look Artificial — Smile Test Drive</h1>
            <p class="hero-sub">Dental Aesthetics with Dr. Carla Christoph</p>
            <p class="hero-desc treatment-hero-description">A provisional simulation right on your teeth before you commit. You see it, feel it, and approve it. Porcelain lenses or composite veneers — each case has its indication. Digital scanning with iTero Element 5D and high-translucency ceramics.</p>
            <div class="hero-badges">
              <span class="badge">20+ years of experience</span>
              <span class="badge">Smile Test Drive</span>
              <span class="badge">CRO-RJ 27.509</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-cta-wrap">
              <a class="btn-hero js-wa-cta" data-label="en-veneers-and-lenses_hero_whatsapp" href={waHero} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Schedule consultation via WhatsApp">
                <Fragment set:html={ic('calendar', 'mr8', 20)} />
                Book Your Consultation
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-img">
            <div class="hero-img-frame">
              <img src="/lovable-uploads/dra-carla-jaleco-bracos-cruzados.webp" alt="Dr. Carla Christoph - Dental Aesthetics That Don't Look Artificial — Smile Test Drive Specialist" width="800" height="1200" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Quick Answer ═══ -->
    <section class="qa-section">
      <div class="container-c">
        <div class="qa-box quick-answer-box">
          <div class="qa-ic"><Fragment set:html={ic('checkCircle2', 'gold', 24)} /></div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="qa-title">Quick Answer</h2>
            <p class="qa-text">Dental contact lenses are ultra-thin porcelain shells (0.2–0.5mm) bonded to teeth with minimal preparation, ideal for lasting aesthetic changes. Composite veneers are thicker restorations (0.7–1.5mm) sculpted directly in the office. At Dr. Carla Christoph's practice in Ipanema, we offer the Smile Test Drive (mock-up) so you can preview the result before starting. Lenses last 15–20 years and don't stain; composite veneers last 5–8 years. Treatment takes 2–3 appointments (15–20 days) for lenses and 1–2 appointments for composite veneers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ Empathetic Pain Points ═══ -->
    <section class="pain-section">
      <div class="narrow-c">
        <h2 class="pain-title">Do you relate to any of these situations?</h2>
        <div class="pain-list">
          <div class="pain-card b-purple">
            <div class="pain-ic"><Fragment set:html={ic('sparkles', 'purple', 24)} /></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Unhappy with the color or shape of your teeth</strong>
              <span>making you avoid smiling naturally in photos and conversations?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-card b-gold">
            <div class="pain-ic"><Fragment set:html={ic('alertCircle', 'gold', 24)} /></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Misaligned, gapped, or chipped teeth</strong>
              <span>affecting your professional and social confidence?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pain-card b-purple-soft">
            <div class="pain-ic"><Fragment set:html={ic('heart', 'purple-soft', 24)} /></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Fear of an artificial-looking result</strong>
              <span>or excessive filing of your natural teeth?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pain-conclusion">Well-planned lenses and veneers deliver naturalness and harmony — without exaggeration.<br class="md-br" /> We offer the Smile Test Drive so you can approve everything before starting.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"><span class="d-line"></span><span class="d-circle"><Fragment set:html={ic('sparkles', '', 20)} /></span><span class="d-line"></span></div>

    <!-- ═══ Why Choose - 3 cards ═══ -->
